# Tunel Oscuro, floor 1 (C4a, contract 39), 28 x 22. `@dark yes` (without the Linterna module only a diamond round the hero is lit; every tile is passable in the dark) and
# `@cave yes` (the Exit Wisp works). column = i, row = j. TWO POCKETS separated by solid rock: the NORTH pocket (the north mouth (24,2) from Ruta 10; the ladder A (5,7) down to floor 2) and the SOUTH
# pocket (the ladder B (22,14) comes up from floor 2; the south mouth (3,20) leads to Ruta 10's south half). The only way between the pockets is floor 2. Look: mid-light rock floor (3 variants), plain rock walls on the back
# sides, rubble and boulders on the front sides, stalagmites, damp moss patches (the tall grass of the cave); three trainers, items.
@map tunel_1
@size 28 22
@interior no
@cave yes
@dark yes
@area tunel_oscuro
@bg 3
@fill cave
@spawn north 24 3 S
@spawn south 3 19 N
@spawn ladder_a 5 8 S
@spawn ladder_b 22 15 S
@encounters grass rate=14
  echolet 19 23 35               # C9 (contract 56): weight lowered to make room for the fill-in (the table still adds up to 100)
  pebblump 19 23 30
  ramplet 19 23 25
  boulderback 22 24 5
  cragodile 22 24 5               # C9 (contract 56): the fill-in of the design notes
@end
# Roaming wild creatures (contract 55, rollout in 63): 2 creatures of this table wander the whole walkable floor (grass included); touching one starts that wild battle.
@roam 2 table=grass area=.f period=1800
@legend
  .  tile=cave
  a  tile=none
  b  tile=none object=cwall_p
  c  tile=none object=rubble
  d  object=hole
  e  npc=chica id=t2 face=S trainer=chica_t1 range=3 text=tr.chica_t1.pre after=tr.chica_t1.after
  f  tile=moss
  g  object=stalag_s
  h  object=sign text=tunel.sign interact=look
  i  object=stalag
  j  item=salve
  k  object=rock
  l  npc=montanista id=t1 face=S trainer=montanista_t1 range=3 text=tr.montanista_t1.pre after=tr.montanista_t1.after
  m  door=rope_ladder
  n  object=boulder
  o  item=rich_salve
  p  item=exit_wisp
  q  door=rope_ladder
  r  npc=explorador id=t3 face=E trainer=explorador_t1 range=3 text=tr.explorador_t1.pre after=tr.explorador_t1.after
  s  object=hole
  t  tile=cave item=life_spark
  H  tile=moss hidden=savia   # hidden (contract 80, hidden items)
